The evaluation set under data/ and the query text in
src/qaudit/eval/labels/retrieval_gold.json are derived from the Bitext customer
support dataset (bitext/Bitext-customer-support-llm-chatbot-training-dataset),
which is licensed under the Community Data License Agreement - Sharing, Version
1.0 (CDLA-Sharing-1.0). Those data portions remain subject to CDLA-Sharing-1.0.
